# Crispy Companion — build-time deployment defaults.
#
# `scripts/builddefaults.sh` reads this file (and CI reads the same two keys
# from repository secrets) when it generates
# internal/config/builddefaults_gen.go, so these values are compiled into the
# binary. Precedence: environment variable > this file.
#
# Copy to `.env` and edit; `.env` is gitignored. These only set *build-time*
# defaults — runtime overrides are the CRISPY_COMPANION_* variables listed at
# the bottom, or config.toml next to the data dir.

# Crispy-server base URL the companion pairs against (RFC 8628 device grant).
# Leave empty to build a fail-closed binary: pairing returns 503 until a URL
# is configured at runtime.
CRISPY_SERVER_URL=https://api.crispytv.tech

# Comma-separated exact web origins allowed to talk to the companion.
# Never use "*": the perimeter reflects these origins and rejects the rest.
CRISPY_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://crispy.app,https://app.crispy.example

# ---- runtime overrides: export these in the shell, they are not read from
# ---- this file. They take precedence over the compiled-in values above.
# CRISPY_COMPANION_SERVER_URL=https://api.crispytv.tech
# CRISPY_COMPANION_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://crispy.app
# CRISPY_COMPANION_LISTEN_ADDR=127.0.0.1
# CRISPY_COMPANION_LISTEN_PORT=11470
# CRISPY_COMPANION_SHARED_MODE=off
# CRISPY_COMPANION_SHARED_LISTEN_ADDR=
# CRISPY_COMPANION_LOG_LEVEL=info
# CRISPY_COMPANION_DATA_DIR=